<p>Mentally focus electricity into a ball of plasma and hurl it at the target.</p><p>The plasma will explode on impact, dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">178, 240, 287, 328, 364</acronym> Lightning damage within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 2, 2, 3.</acronym></p><p>This talent will apply cross tier Brainlock.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower.</p>